# 2026-10-08  A curated routing rule is left alone. `desk.ensure_support_routing()`
#             used to add every holder of a support role to the Assignment Rule,
#             so a `bench migrate` put the administrators back into the rotation
#             that `configure_support.py` had just taken them out of. It now leaves
#             an operator-curated list exactly as it is. Also: the SUPPORT_*
#             variables arrive as empty strings when unset, so the script's
#             defaults are applied on blank rather than only on absent.
#

