#             people and emails them. The shared Assignment Rule and the
#             `Solrise New Ticket` notification now skip a report that has a
#             desk, so an HR report is never handed to - or emailed to - the
#             maintenance rotation; the SLA/stale alerts do the same. HR goes to
#             daniyal@solrise.com, Maintenance and IT to umair.nawaz@.
#             docs/17 section 15. The HR and IT button lists are starting sets.
